        BC PNP Care Priority List 2027: All 36 Healthcare, Childcare, Education and Vet Occupations Explained
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">
        Every NOC code on the Care list, grouped so you can find yours quickly. For each one: what licence or registration you need, which route fits (Health Authority stream or targeted draw), and what the 2026 draws show.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <time datetime="2026-10-14">October 14, 2026</time>
        <span>&bull;</span>
